	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "Amiga Zorro II card edge, 2x50 gold fingers, P2.54mm, mates with EDAC 745-100-520-206 / TE 2-5530843-2. Even pins F.Cu, odd pins B.Cu. Seen from F.Cu with fingers down, pin 2 is rightmost. Origin: finger row centre, tongue tip at Y=0. Tongue outline is a guide on Dwgs.User, not Edge.Cuts. Mating card dims: https://www.te.com/commerce/DocumentDelivery/DDEController?Action=srchrtrv&DocNm=5530843&DocType=Customer+Drawing&DocLang=English")
